{"content":[{"c":["ELEALEH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town in the Transjordan northeast of Heshbon conquered by Reuben and Gad (",{"href":"?bref=Num.32.3,37","r":"Num.32.3,37","rawR":"Num.32.3,37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.32.3,37","value":"Num.32.3,37"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 32:3, 37"},"). It was taken back by the Moabites and is associated with Heshbon in the prophetic denunciations of Moab (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.15.4","r":"Isa.15.4","rawR":"Isa.15.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.15.4","value":"Isa.15.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 15:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.16.9","r":"Isa.16.9","rawR":"Isa.16.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.16.9","value":"Isa.16.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"16:9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.48.34","r":"Jer.48.34","rawR":"Jer.48.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.48.34","value":"Jer.48.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 48:34"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Eusebius refers to it in the fourth century ",{"c":["AD"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," as a large village. It is identified with the modern el-’Al, a village 2,986 feet (910.1 meters) above sea level in a region rich in vineyards. The remains of walls from the prepatriarchal period have been uncovered by archaeologists."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Elealeh","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 32:3, 37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.32.3,37","rawQueryValue":"Num.32.3,37","sourceRefExact":"Num.32.3,37"},{"anchorText":"Is 15:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.15.4","rawQueryValue":"Isa.15.4","sourceRefExact":"Isa.15.4"},{"anchorText":"16:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.16.9","rawQueryValue":"Isa.16.9","sourceRefExact":"Isa.16.9"},{"anchorText":"Jer 48:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.48.34","rawQueryValue":"Jer.48.34","sourceRefExact":"Jer.48.34"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"9eea66c2603734643b66cc388a0942dbc269935174fdc502b5d24e4a0d554498","sourceItemName":"Elealeh","sourceItemOrder":68,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Elealeh","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Elealeh","title":"Elealeh","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}